File descriptions:

ESP.txt: Most basic one and the first version, just character outlines. 
ESP_TEXT: Second version, character outlines and player names.
ESP_HEALTH: Third version, character outlines, player names and player health.
ESP_NOCLIP: Fourth version, character outlines, player names, player health, no clip through walls. Added keybinds.
ESP_NOCLIP_AIMBOT: Fifth version, character outlines, player names, player health, no clip through walls and aim bot.
ESP_NOCLIP_AIMBOT_TOGGLE: Sixth version, character outlines, player names, player health, noclip through walls and aimbot. Added aimbot keybind.
ESP_NOCLIP_AIMBOT_TPWALK: Seventh version, character outlines, player names, player health, noclip through walls, aimbot and tpwalk to walk faster.


